(6483776, 964077, 77543, '<td valign="top">This would be excellent if you cropped to remove the pile of blackberries and shadows at the base. I really like the top three quarters of the picture.</td>', 'This would be excellent if you cropped to remove the pile of blackberries and shadows at the base. I really like the top three quarters of the picture.', '2011-07-29 05:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483816, 964206, 113156, '<td valign="top">That is just sheer gormandize, nice shot.</td>', 'That is just sheer gormandize, nice shot.', '2011-07-29 08:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483818, 964216, 53147, '<td valign="top">Betcha that would go great with a nice glass of Ohio wine. ;) Bumping up.</td>', 'Betcha that would go great with a nice glass of Ohio wine. ;) Bumping up.', '2011-07-29 08:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483819, 964143, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is in my top three. The meal looks very inviting. Aimee wanted to sit down right now and eat it. There is a slight tilt to the image that is odd but this is a standout none the less. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is in my top three. The meal looks very inviting. Aimee wanted to sit down right now and eat it. There is a slight tilt to the image that is odd but this is a standout none the less. Bumping up.', '2011-07-29 08:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483820, 964257, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pleasing image. I really like the reflection of the plate in the glass. Bumping up.</td>', 'Pleasing image. I really like the reflection of the plate in the glass. Bumping up.', '2011-07-29 08:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483822, 964155, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice stock feel to it. I probably would have figured out a way to make the shrimp be more recognizable. Less dressing probably - at least for the image. As it is without the title I wouldnt know what they were. Clean image though.</td>', 'Nice stock feel to it. I probably would have figured out a way to make the shrimp be more recognizable. Less dressing probably - at least for the image. As it is without the title I wouldnt know what they were. Clean image though.', '2011-07-29 08:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483823, 964130, 53147, '<td valign="top">So your plate looks awesome and I would love to dig into it. The cup in the background and whatever is in that bowl though draw away from the plate. The almost flourescent color detracts. The plate looks stunning and ready to eat though.</td>', 'So your plate looks awesome and I would love to dig into it. The cup in the background and whatever is in that bowl though draw away from the plate. The almost flourescent color detracts. The plate looks stunning and ready to eat though.', '2011-07-29 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483824, 964206, 53147, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean image with a pleasantly simple presentation. I may have blurred the steam a bit to make it less grainy and may have toned down the brightness of it (can steam be that bright?). But that is just a tiny nit pick. Bumping up.</td>', 'Lovely clean image with a pleasantly simple presentation. I may have blurred the steam a bit to make it less grainy and may have toned down the brightness of it (can steam be that bright?). But that is just a tiny nit pick. Bumping up.', '2011-07-29 08:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483825, 964187, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good looking plate of food, but the arrangement of the items seems a bit odd, especially with the white background as it is. The negative space doesnt help the image, just makes it feel lopsided. I think if you had taken at a lower angle and allowed the other props be the bokehed background to the plate you would have had a much stronger image.</td>', 'Good looking plate of food, but the arrangement of the items seems a bit odd, especially with the white background as it is. The negative space doesnt help the image, just makes it feel lopsided. I think if you had taken at a lower angle and allowed the other props be the bokehed background to the plate you would have had a much stronger image.', '2011-07-29 08:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483826, 964064, 53147, '<td valign="top">Clean, bright and colorful. Not exactly what I was hoping for in a challenge entry but pleasing none the less.</td>', 'Clean, bright and colorful. Not exactly what I was hoping for in a challenge entry but pleasing none the less.', '2011-07-29 08:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483829, 964284, 53147, '<td valign="top">From an artistic perspective this image isn''t doing much for me. From a foodie perspective I want to chow down on this right now. So I have mixed feelings on it as an entry.</td>', 'From an artistic perspective this image isn''t doing much for me. From a foodie perspective I want to chow down on this right now. So I have mixed feelings on it as an entry.', '2011-07-29 08:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483830, 964293, 53147, '<td valign="top">Loving the slice of light down her face. Probably tanking in score, but a fun pic none the less.</td>', 'Loving the slice of light down her face. Probably tanking in score, but a fun pic none the less.', '2011-07-29 08:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483849, 964079, 53147, '<td valign="top">A staple in my house. Probably eat them almost weekly. So I am connecting well with your subject from a foodie perspective. From a photography perspective it is a bit lacking. Snapshot feel to it, cropped way too tight. I think you could have been a bit more creative with the image. Would gladly take an invite to come over and dine with you though.</td>', 'A staple in my house. Probably eat them almost weekly. So I am connecting well with your subject from a foodie perspective. From a photography perspective it is a bit lacking. Snapshot feel to it, cropped way too tight. I think you could have been a bit more creative with the image. Would gladly take an invite to come over and dine with you though.', '2011-07-29 08:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483850, 964289, 53147, '<td valign="top">The color balance and tones just arent good for sushi. My eye craves the bright crisp colors that could be playing out. The brown/orange tones just make the meal look unappetizing.</td>', 'The color balance and tones just arent good for sushi. My eye craves the bright crisp colors that could be playing out. The brown/orange tones just make the meal look unappetizing.', '2011-07-29 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483851, 964275, 53147, '<td valign="top">As far as the challenge goes you gave me a good laugh, but pretty much falls into the DNMC. On the other hand it is one of the better technical images in the challenge with good lighting, colors and dof. I was probably a bit harsh on my first vote so I am going to bump up now.</td>', 'As far as the challenge goes you gave me a good laugh, but pretty much falls into the DNMC. On the other hand it is one of the better technical images in the challenge with good lighting, colors and dof. I was probably a bit harsh on my first vote so I am going to bump up now.', '2011-07-29 08:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483860, 964149, 10785, '<td valign="top">Rebel!</td>', 'Rebel!', '2011-07-29 09:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483862, 964141, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and the food looks Yummy. I would suggest a slower shutter speed to let in more light or increasing the exposure in your raw editing to brighten this up a bit. It is just underexposed.</td>', 'Very good composition and the food looks Yummy. I would suggest a slower shutter speed to let in more light or increasing the exposure in your raw editing to brighten this up a bit. It is just underexposed.', '2011-07-29 09:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483864, 964143, 10785, '<td valign="top">Looks good. Great exposure. As far as composition... your inclusion of the table at the top of the frame and having that area be the brightest spot in the photo leads my eye away from the subject into your blurred background. I would suggest get in closer to the subject and lose the background.</td>', 'Looks good. Great exposure. As far as composition... your inclusion of the table at the top of the frame and having that area be the brightest spot in the photo leads my eye away from the subject into your blurred background. I would suggest get in closer to the subject and lose the background.', '2011-07-29 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483866, 963633, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s like an early morning sunrise is lighting the top of the bread. Nice light.</td>', 'It''s like an early morning sunrise is lighting the top of the bread. Nice light.', '2011-07-29 09:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483870, 964238, 10785, '<td valign="top">Gory!</td>', 'Gory!', '2011-07-29 09:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483871, 964275, 10785, '<td valign="top">Petulance and Cheetos go well together!</td>', 'Petulance and Cheetos go well together!', '2011-07-29 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483873, 964247, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very, very underexposed. I guess the superior man also uses light sparingly!</td>', 'Very, very underexposed. I guess the superior man also uses light sparingly!', '2011-07-29 09:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483874, 964293, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like how the light makes the girls face the focal point. Very good use of that technique. This photo dances very loosely around the challenge concept.</td>', 'I like how the light makes the girls face the focal point. Very good use of that technique. This photo dances very loosely around the challenge concept.', '2011-07-29 09:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
