(6483894, 964240, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d never heard of that til I watched a Giada DeLaurentis episode of everyday Italian.  Then Rachel Ray made her version.  Whatever you did, it looks delicious.  Man, am I hungry now. :)</td>', 'I''d never heard of that til I watched a Giada DeLaurentis episode of everyday Italian.  Then Rachel Ray made her version.  Whatever you did, it looks delicious.  Man, am I hungry now. :)', '2011-07-29 10:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483895, 963820, 15711, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this are the petunias in the background.  Adds such a down home feel to it.  Whatever you''re making, it looks good to me. :)</td>', 'My favorite part of this are the petunias in the background.  Adds such a down home feel to it.  Whatever you''re making, it looks good to me. :)', '2011-07-29 10:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483896, 964180, 15711, '<td valign="top">YUMM  My basil plants go wild every summer but with this heat wave, I have to water them twice a day.  Isn''t your dish called bruscetta?  Whatever, it sure does make me hungry.</td>', 'YUMM  My basil plants go wild every summer but with this heat wave, I have to water them twice a day.  Isn''t your dish called bruscetta?  Whatever, it sure does make me hungry.', '2011-07-29 10:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483898, 964249, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not something I want to eat but the presentation is really nice. :)</td>', 'Not something I want to eat but the presentation is really nice. :)', '2011-07-29 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483899, 964284, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOD THAT LOOKS GOOD!!!! I can see this on a page in Southern Living or The Food Network magazine.  As Rachel Ray would say "yummo!"</td>', 'GOD THAT LOOKS GOOD!!!! I can see this on a page in Southern Living or The Food Network magazine.  As Rachel Ray would say "yummo!"', '2011-07-29 10:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
