(6483905, 964275, 15711, '<td valign="top">If you have a recipe for puffed Cheetos, I''ll eat my hat.  ROFL</td>', 'If you have a recipe for puffed Cheetos, I''ll eat my hat.  ROFL', '2011-07-29 10:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483906, 964155, 15711, '<td valign="top">That looks really good.  I like your simple approach.  Great use of negative space.</td>', 'That looks really good.  I like your simple approach.  Great use of negative space.', '2011-07-29 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483907, 963629, 15711, '<td valign="top">So far, I think the best presentation so far.  Looks like something in a magazine spread.  I can see a food stylist tweaking it to make it look like this. I''d eat that. :) 8</td>', 'So far, I think the best presentation so far.  Looks like something in a magazine spread.  I can see a food stylist tweaking it to make it look like this. I''d eat that. :) 8', '2011-07-29 10:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483909, 963633, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW that looks so good.  I can see this on the cover of Better Homes and Gardens or a bread recipe book.  YUMMMMM</td>', 'WOW that looks so good.  I can see this on the cover of Better Homes and Gardens or a bread recipe book.  YUMMMMM', '2011-07-29 10:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483916, 964216, 43463, '<td valign="top">Dressing up turkey in new and exciting ways for the taste buds. Great presentation - angle, color, and details are fabulous. Textures are also very appetizing in this culinary arrangement - from the colors &amp; shape of the bed of rice to the yellow &amp; red lemon and chili sauce topping on the turkey.</td>', 'Dressing up turkey in new and exciting ways for the taste buds. Great presentation - angle, color, and details are fabulous. Textures are also very appetizing in this culinary arrangement - from the colors & shape of the bed of rice to the yellow & red lemon and chili sauce topping on the turkey.', '2011-07-29 10:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483918, 964240, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great presentation of this salad - bringing our eyes to the feast with the main course set before us with mouthwatering detail. Crisp greens of cucumber, vibrant reds with the cherry tomatoes and rich &amp; toasty browns of the bread cubes - it looks delicious! The backdrop for this dish makes it look warm and inviting - a summer picnic.</td>', 'Great presentation of this salad - bringing our eyes to the feast with the main course set before us with mouthwatering detail. Crisp greens of cucumber, vibrant reds with the cherry tomatoes and rich & toasty browns of the bread cubes - it looks delicious! The backdrop for this dish makes it look warm and inviting - a summer picnic.', '2011-07-29 10:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483930, 964180, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to leave comments now. Lovely presentation of this tasty appetizer. Love the design on the plate for it adds a nod to this being an italian recipe. Lighting on the subject is lovely and the colors really pop. My critiques are small but I feel it would have made this even more mouthwatering. The bread looks a little too dry and toasty - visually it makes me want to reach out for the bottle of olive oil that I am sure that is just out of sight of the composition. Don''t get me wrong a good crisp crunchy bread is good but with a dash of olive oil when toasted or after will make it taste divine. It may have had that olive oil added to the bread but don''t ''see'' any evidence of that - if that is the case then pulling back a bit to include an attractive bottle of olive and maybe a pepper shaker in the background bokeh style would have added some punch to the shot. The other critique is that the basil doesn''t look 100% tip top fresh - the edges of the cut basil look bruised with the deeper green edges - it looks like it has had time to sit and either absorb the juices from the tomatoes or it shows the bruising after x amount of time after cutting. It is still fresh but just not ''30 seconds straight out from the kitchen prepared fresh''. Still a simple, tasty, and well presented snack that garners an 8.</td>', 'Coming back to leave comments now. Lovely presentation of this tasty appetizer. Love the design on the plate for it adds a nod to this being an italian recipe. Lighting on the subject is lovely and the colors really pop. My critiques are small but I feel it would have made this even more mouthwatering. The bread looks a little too dry and toasty - visually it makes me want to reach out for the bottle of olive oil that I am sure that is just out of sight of the composition. Don''t get me wrong a good crisp crunchy bread is good but with a dash of olive oil when toasted or after will make it taste divine. It may have had that olive oil added to the bread but don''t ''see'' any evidence of that - if that is the case then pulling back a bit to include an attractive bottle of olive and maybe a pepper shaker in the background bokeh style would have added some punch to the shot. The other critique is that the basil doesn''t look 100% tip top fresh - the edges of the cut basil look bruised with the deeper green edges - it looks like it has had time to sit and either absorb the juices from the tomatoes or it shows the bruising after x amount of time after cutting. It is still fresh but just not ''30 seconds straight out from the kitchen prepared fresh''. Still a simple, tasty, and well presented snack that garners an 8.', '2011-07-29 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483934, 964280, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to leave some comments now. Presentation and lighting is wonderful! The details in the muffins are great from the poppy seeds scattered throughout and the tones of shadow &amp; highlights are very dynamic. It looks appetizing but without the color it lacks the eye-popping goodness that would beckon us to run over for a taste. Color would be the extra enticement to make our eyes and mouth water for a bite of these tasty muffins.</td>', 'Coming back to leave some comments now. Presentation and lighting is wonderful! The details in the muffins are great from the poppy seeds scattered throughout and the tones of shadow & highlights are very dynamic. It looks appetizing but without the color it lacks the eye-popping goodness that would beckon us to run over for a taste. Color would be the extra enticement to make our eyes and mouth water for a bite of these tasty muffins.', '2011-07-29 11:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483935, 964181, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great! I really like this idea and the execution. I wish it were slighly brighter, but I still think it''s great.</td>', 'Great! I really like this idea and the execution. I wish it were slighly brighter, but I still think it''s great.', '2011-07-29 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483936, 964270, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. "Food" is a bit of a stretch here, but I feel lenient today :)</td>', 'I like the idea. "Food" is a bit of a stretch here, but I feel lenient today :)', '2011-07-29 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483937, 964216, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo of a wonderful looking meal. I will be sure to look up the recipe at the end of the challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo of a wonderful looking meal. I will be sure to look up the recipe at the end of the challenge.', '2011-07-29 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483938, 964249, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of food, I bet it''s decently tasty.<br/>I''m not a fan of the giant black border. It feels like you are hiding something in this photo, and it makes the bright whites even brighter.</td>', 'Interesting mix of food, I bet it''s decently tasty.I''m not a fan of the giant black border. It feels like you are hiding something in this photo, and it makes the bright whites even brighter.', '2011-07-29 11:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483939, 964284, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum yum yum! This is truly making my mouth water. I like your perspective on this shot. Unusual but very appealing.</td>', 'Yum yum yum! This is truly making my mouth water. I like your perspective on this shot. Unusual but very appealing.', '2011-07-29 11:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483941, 964240, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like how you included various ingredients in the background and overall lit this very well.</td>', 'I really like how you included various ingredients in the background and overall lit this very well.', '2011-07-29 11:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483943, 964277, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your food placement and composition. I''m however not at all liking the blurred foreground. To me having that sharp is essential to drawing in the attention. I wonder if you could have either used a larger depth of field, or maybe used some focus stacking techniques.</td>', 'I like your food placement and composition. I''m however not at all liking the blurred foreground. To me having that sharp is essential to drawing in the attention. I wonder if you could have either used a larger depth of field, or maybe used some focus stacking techniques.', '2011-07-29 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483944, 964262, 43463, '<td valign="top">OH....MY....LOL! Very different take on the challenge. Love the humor in this one! Nice attention to adding details to the shot from the chocolate chips to cracked/dropped egg to the footprint seen in the flour scattered on the floor. The humor carries the shot and the idea holds much promise (6) but it just needs a little extra umph on the technicals....lighting appears a bit harsh and mayhap angle could be a tad lower to show more of the feet and legs and mayhap some of the kitchen drawers (just to strengthen the imagery of this being in the kitchen)</td>', 'OH....MY....LOL! Very different take on the challenge. Love the humor in this one! Nice attention to adding details to the shot from the chocolate chips to cracked/dropped egg to the footprint seen in the flour scattered on the floor. The humor carries the shot and the idea holds much promise (6) but it just needs a little extra umph on the technicals....lighting appears a bit harsh and mayhap angle could be a tad lower to show more of the feet and legs and mayhap some of the kitchen drawers (just to strengthen the imagery of this being in the kitchen)', '2011-07-29 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483945, 964206, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous and mouth watering. A well done photo.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous and mouth watering. A well done photo.', '2011-07-29 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483946, 963629, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like a bite sized salad. I really like the focus separation between the bowl and the plate.</td>', 'Looks like a bite sized salad. I really like the focus separation between the bowl and the plate.', '2011-07-29 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483947, 964241, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum. I do appreciate how you are trying to fill the scene with your subjects. However, I feel tat the placement could use a bit of work. Maybe show off the chicken a bit more (and make sure it''s in focus), with a tomato playing a supporting role instead of the main feature.</td>', 'Yum. I do appreciate how you are trying to fill the scene with your subjects. However, I feel tat the placement could use a bit of work. Maybe show off the chicken a bit more (and make sure it''s in focus), with a tomato playing a supporting role instead of the main feature.', '2011-07-29 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483949, 964280, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of black and white for this photo. I''m sure the colors weren''t much to look at, and the B&amp;W really brings out those extra details.</td>', 'I like the choice of black and white for this photo. I''m sure the colors weren''t much to look at, and the B&W really brings out those extra details.', '2011-07-29 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483950, 964212, 114225, '<td valign="top">I could go for some of this right about now.<br/>I would like to suggest that you make sure to watch out for deep shadows in a photo like this. The viewer normally wants to see details in the entire scene, which these shadows are hiding. Maybe another light source from the left would help.</td>', 'I could go for some of this right about now.I would like to suggest that you make sure to watch out for deep shadows in a photo like this. The viewer normally wants to see details in the entire scene, which these shadows are hiding. Maybe another light source from the left would help.', '2011-07-29 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483951, 964187, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great look meal and nice job with the setup. The one thing that is really bothering me is how dizzy I feel looking at this because of the major tilt.</td>', 'Great look meal and nice job with the setup. The one thing that is really bothering me is how dizzy I feel looking at this because of the major tilt.', '2011-07-29 11:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
