(6484219, 964064, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im looking forward to seeing the recipe for this, Ive never seen a pea and tomato salad. Image is very nice and well lit.</td>', 'Im looking forward to seeing the recipe for this, Ive never seen a pea and tomato salad. Image is very nice and well lit.', '2011-07-29 14:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484224, 964241, 16106, '<td valign="top">The corn looks great, but the tomato slices look a bit raggedy, I wish the corn was the centerpoint.</td>', 'The corn looks great, but the tomato slices look a bit raggedy, I wish the corn was the centerpoint.', '2011-07-29 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484230, 964287, 53147, '<td valign="top">I do enjoy eating snails (the fresher the better), so I appreciate the take on this image. That said, the presentation of your model really isn''t that pleasing. Poor angle on the shell and the stuff around the opening just looks kind of gross. Maybe waiting a bit for him to come out and show his head would have been worth it.</td>', 'I do enjoy eating snails (the fresher the better), so I appreciate the take on this image. That said, the presentation of your model really isn''t that pleasing. Poor angle on the shell and the stuff around the opening just looks kind of gross. Maybe waiting a bit for him to come out and show his head would have been worth it.', '2011-07-29 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484235, 964143, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dish, great set up, my only issue is the flatness of the light in the bowl. I wish you had a bit more contrast and highlights in the bowl to give sparkle and pop. Never the less best of the batch so far</td>', 'Beautiful dish, great set up, my only issue is the flatness of the light in the bowl. I wish you had a bit more contrast and highlights in the bowl to give sparkle and pop. Never the less best of the batch so far', '2011-07-29 14:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484239, 964277, 53147, '<td valign="top">I do enjoy good sashimi. You have a plate that obviously was prepared to be visually pleasing, but the capture of the image makes it fall. Dof is too shallow with no real focus or main point of interest. The flower stands out, but I wouldn''t say that was a good thing. I think from a different angle , with more in focus you would have had a stronger image. Bet you had a wonderful meal though.</td>', 'I do enjoy good sashimi. You have a plate that obviously was prepared to be visually pleasing, but the capture of the image makes it fall. Dof is too shallow with no real focus or main point of interest. The flower stands out, but I wouldn''t say that was a good thing. I think from a different angle , with more in focus you would have had a stronger image. Bet you had a wonderful meal though.', '2011-07-29 14:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484242, 964249, 16106, '<td valign="top">The tapioca looks great, but the tuna is blown in the highlights, and framed like an after thought. If it has the same lovely lighting and glistening highlights the pudding has, it would be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'The tapioca looks great, but the tuna is blown in the highlights, and framed like an after thought. If it has the same lovely lighting and glistening highlights the pudding has, it would be a ribbon winner.', '2011-07-29 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484243, 964077, 16106, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but the cropping seems gratuitously tight. A bit more room for the subject to breath would have helped.</td>', 'I love the colors, but the cropping seems gratuitously tight. A bit more room for the subject to breath would have helped.', '2011-07-29 14:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484252, 964180, 16106, '<td valign="top">I think the vivid colors of the plate steal the drama from the food. A simpler plate or even a cutting board would have made the bruschetta the soloist, while here it seems to be playing a duette.</td>', 'I think the vivid colors of the plate steal the drama from the food. A simpler plate or even a cutting board would have made the bruschetta the soloist, while here it seems to be playing a duette.', '2011-07-29 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484267, 964238, 16106, '<td valign="top">The processing just makes this look evil, like something that would come out of Mr. Dahmer''s kitchen, The flecks of color rising out of dark broth, with the fractal sheen of fat dancing across the top. Ill bet it smells great, but the processing makes me think that Kosher might be a good idea.</td>', 'The processing just makes this look evil, like something that would come out of Mr. Dahmer''s kitchen, The flecks of color rising out of dark broth, with the fractal sheen of fat dancing across the top. Ill bet it smells great, but the processing makes me think that Kosher might be a good idea.', '2011-07-29 15:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484285, 964079, 117534, '<td valign="top">We call that Beer Butt Chicken down here! Yours looks yummmmmmmy</td>', 'We call that Beer Butt Chicken down here! Yours looks yummmmmmmy', '2011-07-29 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484288, 964275, 117534, '<td valign="top">YAY for you!!! When I saw you had to include the recipie... thought NOT the challenge for me!! Get an 8 just for honesty and the yummy looking cheetoes!!</td>', 'YAY for you!!! When I saw you had to include the recipie... thought NOT the challenge for me!! Get an 8 just for honesty and the yummy looking cheetoes!!', '2011-07-29 15:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484289, 964025, 117534, '<td valign="top">Great capture! you really Whacked that egg!!</td>', 'Great capture! you really Whacked that egg!!', '2011-07-29 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
