(6484343, 964155, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the setup and the negative space. Something seems a little odd about the lighting. Perhaps a little harsh? 7</td>', 'I like the setup and the negative space. Something seems a little odd about the lighting. Perhaps a little harsh? 7', '2011-07-29 16:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
