(6484387, 964141, 136232, '<td valign="top">The white place-mat under the platter doesn''t help with the piece, choosing a red/green/yellow would reference the photo, or black would help add three-dimensionality.</td>', 'The white place-mat under the platter doesn''t help with the piece, choosing a red/green/yellow would reference the photo, or black would help add three-dimensionality.', '2011-07-29 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
