(6484389, 964240, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how it''s exotic sounding food, on an obvious picnic table.  The ingredients in the background are great, and it looks more artsy with a sense of space instead of a menu photo.</td>', 'I like how it''s exotic sounding food, on an obvious picnic table.  The ingredients in the background are great, and it looks more artsy with a sense of space instead of a menu photo.', '2011-07-29 16:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
