(6484393, 964280, 53147, '<td valign="top">From thumbnail this image looked strong. In full view though it appears to fall a bit short of in focus. I want that front muffing to be sharp with the rest fading away as pleasantly as they are. It''s just not quite there for me. Hope they were yummy.</td>', 'From thumbnail this image looked strong. In full view though it appears to fall a bit short of in focus. I want that front muffing to be sharp with the rest fading away as pleasantly as they are. It''s just not quite there for me. Hope they were yummy.', '2011-07-29 16:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484394, 964186, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how you used a platter with some color, and a textured surface.  Might have been nice to see some of the icing dripping down the side, or have a bite out of it with icing on the plate so you see it while being eaten to add some drama.</td>', 'I like how you used a platter with some color, and a textured surface.  Might have been nice to see some of the icing dripping down the side, or have a bite out of it with icing on the plate so you see it while being eaten to add some drama.', '2011-07-29 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484395, 964206, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the textures of the berries, lighting, and steam.  You have nice silhouettes and the colors go well with rich but fruity and elegant.</td>', 'I love the textures of the berries, lighting, and steam.  You have nice silhouettes and the colors go well with rich but fruity and elegant.', '2011-07-29 16:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484396, 964258, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. The background seems to have an odd reddish (or at least an off white) tint that isn''t so good. Maybe a slightly tighter crop, perhaps square would make the image a bit stronger as well.</td>', 'Nice and simple. The background seems to have an odd reddish (or at least an off white) tint that isn''t so good. Maybe a slightly tighter crop, perhaps square would make the image a bit stronger as well.', '2011-07-29 16:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484398, 964233, 136232, '<td valign="top">I would have liked more play with the lighting.  It looks like it could be terrain on a foreign planet- so maybe an army man climbing a pepperoni would fit nicely.</td>', 'I would have liked more play with the lighting.  It looks like it could be terrain on a foreign planet- so maybe an army man climbing a pepperoni would fit nicely.', '2011-07-29 16:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484399, 964277, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, colors, and addition of the flower.  It looks light and healthy.  I''m not sure what''s in the front though, green cylindres... the vertical one could have been removed and the piece would be perfect.</td>', 'I love the lighting, colors, and addition of the flower.  It looks light and healthy.  I''m not sure what''s in the front though, green cylindres... the vertical one could have been removed and the piece would be perfect.', '2011-07-29 16:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484401, 964155, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute shape in space.  I like the placement of the greens ontop of the food.</td>', 'Cute shape in space.  I like the placement of the greens ontop of the food.', '2011-07-29 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484402, 964212, 53147, '<td valign="top">I would definitely dig into this bowl. Love a good banana ice cream. Photographically speaking it could have been stronger, crop is a bit unbalanced on the sides. Probably would have preferred a square crop maybe showing the entire bowl.</td>', 'I would definitely dig into this bowl. Love a good banana ice cream. Photographically speaking it could have been stronger, crop is a bit unbalanced on the sides. Probably would have preferred a square crop maybe showing the entire bowl.', '2011-07-29 16:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484403, 964181, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the angle/action shot.  I lve what looks like a vortex taking in the powdered chocolate, and the contrast wit the light milk and black background.</td>', 'I love the angle/action shot.  I lve what looks like a vortex taking in the powdered chocolate, and the contrast wit the light milk and black background.', '2011-07-29 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484405, 964180, 53147, '<td valign="top">Love eating food like this. Fresh and clean. I think your plate is a bit overkill with color and pattern. Draws away from the colors on your food.</td>', 'Love eating food like this. Fresh and clean. I think your plate is a bit overkill with color and pattern. Draws away from the colors on your food.', '2011-07-29 16:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484407, 964025, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love this stop-action piece!  It''s beautifully done, with bits of eggs breaking apart and the yolk shattering.  The neutral background helps give contrast to the bright egg and glass, and I love the lighting where even the flecks on the right side seem to glow in mid air.</td>', 'I love this stop-action piece!  It''s beautifully done, with bits of eggs breaking apart and the yolk shattering.  The neutral background helps give contrast to the bright egg and glass, and I love the lighting where even the flecks on the right side seem to glow in mid air.', '2011-07-29 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484408, 964293, 136232, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a little more expression on the girl''s face, as an "eew" what are you doing, or a "haha" this boy''s funny.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a little more expression on the girl''s face, as an "eew" what are you doing, or a "haha" this boy''s funny.', '2011-07-29 16:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484410, 964130, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the reds in the background but oranges in the foreground.  The central prawn at that angle makes this pic for me. Nice lighting too.</td>', 'I love the reds in the background but oranges in the foreground.  The central prawn at that angle makes this pic for me. Nice lighting too.', '2011-07-29 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484412, 964240, 53147, '<td valign="top">Had to look up what panzanella was.Thought it looked like toasted bread cubes. Betcha this is quite yummy. Pleasing image overall. Good use of bokehed props. Has a slight tilt that is a bit odd but not a big issue. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'Had to look up what panzanella was.Thought it looked like toasted bread cubes. Betcha this is quite yummy. Pleasing image overall. Good use of bokehed props. Has a slight tilt that is a bit odd but not a big issue. Bumping up 1.', '2011-07-29 16:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484413, 964284, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the oozing of the sauce, rich spiciness of the chicken, flaky texture of the bread, and skratchy textrue of the table.  Nice contrast of colors, and a sense of movement.</td>', 'I love the oozing of the sauce, rich spiciness of the chicken, flaky texture of the bread, and skratchy textrue of the table.  Nice contrast of colors, and a sense of movement.', '2011-07-29 16:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484416, 963820, 136232, '<td valign="top">The simple flowers in the background are beautiful with the rustic bag of chips and bottles.  I love how everything is half full, and angled.  Even the tomatoes look old fashioned.</td>', 'The simple flowers in the background are beautiful with the rustic bag of chips and bottles.  I love how everything is half full, and angled.  Even the tomatoes look old fashioned.', '2011-07-29 16:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484417, 964238, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and reflection of the drops on the side of the pan. The mix of white with blues, reds, and oranges make this piece!</td>', 'I love the colors and reflection of the drops on the side of the pan. The mix of white with blues, reds, and oranges make this piece!', '2011-07-29 16:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484418, 964238, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Sure doesn''t make me hungry looking at it, but the colors and textures are intriguing none the less. Bumping up a bit as I was probably too harsh on it the first go through.</td>', 'Interesting image. Sure doesn''t make me hungry looking at it, but the colors and textures are intriguing none the less. Bumping up a bit as I was probably too harsh on it the first go through.', '2011-07-29 16:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484419, 964077, 136232, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, making a summer drink elegant.  I love the contrast with black and white background, and the black berried added at the top as well as side of the drink.  The curvy reflection on the glass is quite artsy, and I love how there''s berry juice on the bottom right side... which makes it real.</td>', 'Very beautiful, making a summer drink elegant.  I love the contrast with black and white background, and the black berried added at the top as well as side of the drink.  The curvy reflection on the glass is quite artsy, and I love how there''s berry juice on the bottom right side... which makes it real.', '2011-07-29 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484420, 964250, 53147, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby, love a good cream puff. I may have gone with a square crop on this and gotten rid of some of the upper background. Not sure if it really adds anything to the image. Probably would have tweaked the cream and made it a bit less yellow and more white. The image overall has a slight yellow cast on my monitor. Bumping up 1 as I was probably a bit harsh the first time through.</td>', 'Yeah baby, love a good cream puff. I may have gone with a square crop on this and gotten rid of some of the upper background. Not sure if it really adds anything to the image. Probably would have tweaked the cream and made it a bit less yellow and more white. The image overall has a slight yellow cast on my monitor. Bumping up 1 as I was probably a bit harsh the first time through.', '2011-07-29 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484423, 964025, 53147, '<td valign="top">Slightly interesting out of the box thinking but it doesn;t grab me overall.</td>', 'Slightly interesting out of the box thinking but it doesn;t grab me overall.', '2011-07-29 16:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484424, 964187, 136232, '<td valign="top">Great use of tropical stick and pottery.  The drink looks like a pineapple squeezed into a glass, which is awesome.  I love the textures with the lines on the stick and pottery, the waves of the tacos and placemat, and the solids of the corn salad.  I think the white platter looks okay, but the table it is on top of should be a different color like black or blue to give a better sense of space/not just floating.</td>', 'Great use of tropical stick and pottery.  The drink looks like a pineapple squeezed into a glass, which is awesome.  I love the textures with the lines on the stick and pottery, the waves of the tacos and placemat, and the solids of the corn salad.  I think the white platter looks okay, but the table it is on top of should be a different color like black or blue to give a better sense of space/not just floating.', '2011-07-29 16:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484425, 964276, 53147, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t do much for me either within the challenge description or well outside of it.</td>', 'This one doesn''t do much for me either within the challenge description or well outside of it.', '2011-07-29 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484426, 964276, 136232, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to what this is.</td>', 'I''m curious to what this is.', '2011-07-29 16:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484427, 964181, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you might have an interesting base idea here but it''s execution leaves it in the "meh" category for me.</td>', 'I think you might have an interesting base idea here but it''s execution leaves it in the "meh" category for me.', '2011-07-29 16:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484428, 964258, 136232, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the background be a different color, like blue or even black to let the mild and powder contrast and become more three-dimensional.</td>', 'I''d like to see the background be a different color, like blue or even black to let the mild and powder contrast and become more three-dimensional.', '2011-07-29 16:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484429, 964064, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors and three-dimensionality.  I also love how the tomatoes are still connected and one is at an angle.  Looks fresh and healthy.</td>', 'I like the bright colors and three-dimensionality.  I also love how the tomatoes are still connected and one is at an angle.  Looks fresh and healthy.', '2011-07-29 16:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484430, 964143, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the angles of the shells to the fish and the oven mitt stripes.  I also love the earthy food and bowl, with the elegant table setting with wine.</td>', 'I love the angles of the shells to the fish and the oven mitt stripes.  I also love the earthy food and bowl, with the elegant table setting with wine.', '2011-07-29 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484432, 964079, 136232, '<td valign="top">I''ve also heard this called "Beer Butt Chicken (BBC)" Nice colors... I almost see the gansta chicken with the wings pointed as if to say "yo-yo-yo"</td>', 'I''ve also heard this called "Beer Butt Chicken (BBC)" Nice colors... I almost see the gansta chicken with the wings pointed as if to say "yo-yo-yo"', '2011-07-29 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484435, 964141, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is one plate in the challenge that I would be very interested in trying. I love chicken wings and this prep looks spicy and tasty. Photographically it''s a bit flat. I desire to see more of the dish in the picture, and the whites and brightness to be bumped up a bit to really give the colors in your dish the canvas to pop. Just a bit too tight and not bright enough for me. Yet i am still going to bump it up 1 as i was probably a bit hard on it the first time through voting.</td>', 'This is one plate in the challenge that I would be very interested in trying. I love chicken wings and this prep looks spicy and tasty. Photographically it''s a bit flat. I desire to see more of the dish in the picture, and the whites and brightness to be bumped up a bit to really give the colors in your dish the canvas to pop. Just a bit too tight and not bright enough for me. Yet i am still going to bump it up 1 as i was probably a bit hard on it the first time through voting.', '2011-07-29 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484438, 964149, 53147, '<td valign="top">I appreciate out of the box, artistic and even blurry images (look at my fave list), but this one isn''t doing a whole lot for me. Slightly curious as to what it is but only slightly.</td>', 'I appreciate out of the box, artistic and even blurry images (look at my fave list), but this one isn''t doing a whole lot for me. Slightly curious as to what it is but only slightly.', '2011-07-29 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484439, 964262, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny and a decent out of the box entry. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'This is pretty funny and a decent out of the box entry. Bumping up 1.', '2011-07-29 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484442, 964064, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to leave comments after voting. Wonderful lighting that spotlights the rich red of the tomatoes and the verdant greens of the peas. I like the addition of the water to the tomatoes for not only does it add visual interest it is a subtle not to the prep stage of preparing the salad. Great picture of these veggies 7 (oh, wait, tomatoes are considered fruit).</td>', 'Coming back to leave comments after voting. Wonderful lighting that spotlights the rich red of the tomatoes and the verdant greens of the peas. I like the addition of the water to the tomatoes for not only does it add visual interest it is a subtle not to the prep stage of preparing the salad. Great picture of these veggies 7 (oh, wait, tomatoes are considered fruit).', '2011-07-29 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484445, 963899, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment and bumping up the score as well. O.K. the turtle and the humor of the photo made me think of Alfred Bester''s short story "Gourmet Dining in Outer Space". The chef in the story is hilarious and one course he made was turtle soup. But I am rambling away from the shot. Love the humor in the shot -it tips the scales away from the normal shelled out recipes;-p Details and color and composition are great. Love the bokeh backdrop with the eggs and greens that will be added to the soup. The turtle seems to be haming it up for the camera and the audience. My only plaint is the composition could use a dash more saturation and contrast between shadows/highlights - not too much mind, just a pinch more to bring it up a notch because it looks a tad washed out.</td>', 'Coming back to comment and bumping up the score as well. O.K. the turtle and the humor of the photo made me think of Alfred Bester''s short story "Gourmet Dining in Outer Space". The chef in the story is hilarious and one course he made was turtle soup. But I am rambling away from the shot. Love the humor in the shot -it tips the scales away from the normal shelled out recipes;-p Details and color and composition are great. Love the bokeh backdrop with the eggs and greens that will be added to the soup. The turtle seems to be haming it up for the camera and the audience. My only plaint is the composition could use a dash more saturation and contrast between shadows/highlights - not too much mind, just a pinch more to bring it up a notch because it looks a tad washed out.', '2011-07-29 17:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484456, 964212, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to leave comments after voting. MMmmm, ice cream. You have some <b>great </b>tones in the color of the cream - white, rich and creamy with pieces of banana in the scoops. Very appealing and tasty looking. The presentation of the ice cream however could be better. A straight down shot does very little to boast the appeal of the ice cream. A suggestion to make the composition more mouth watering and shoot the composition into the excellent category (8-10) I would recommend shooting it at a lower angle such that the ice cream is rising above the lip of the bowl. Giving us a bowl of plenty - a mountain of ice cream that we can plunge a spoon into!!!!</td>', 'Coming back to leave comments after voting. MMmmm, ice cream. You have some great tones in the color of the cream - white, rich and creamy with pieces of banana in the scoops. Very appealing and tasty looking. The presentation of the ice cream however could be better. A straight down shot does very little to boast the appeal of the ice cream. A suggestion to make the composition more mouth watering and shoot the composition into the excellent category (8-10) I would recommend shooting it at a lower angle such that the ice cream is rising above the lip of the bowl. Giving us a bowl of plenty - a mountain of ice cream that we can plunge a spoon into!!!!', '2011-07-29 17:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484475, 964238, 69034, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shot!  Love the wooden spoon.  Love the Processing.  Excellent composition.</td>', 'Beautiful Shot!  Love the wooden spoon.  Love the Processing.  Excellent composition.', '2011-07-29 18:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484479, 964287, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment after voting. Not a fan of escargot but I have to admit the presentation of the elements and the technicals of the photo are great. Lighting brings out the colors and details of the subject(s) Love how you had the green shoot of leaf come into the composition at a diagonal. It rises out of the bottom left corner, presents the main ingredient just off center of the photo and continues to travel towards the top right corner.</td>', 'Coming back to comment after voting. Not a fan of escargot but I have to admit the presentation of the elements and the technicals of the photo are great. Lighting brings out the colors and details of the subject(s) Love how you had the green shoot of leaf come into the composition at a diagonal. It rises out of the bottom left corner, presents the main ingredient just off center of the photo and continues to travel towards the top right corner.', '2011-07-29 18:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484485, 964262, 86090, '<td valign="top">very cute concept. Nice work!</td>', 'very cute concept. Nice work!', '2011-07-29 18:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484486, 964130, 86090, '<td valign="top">The food looks really good and the added elements go well with the overall cocept.</td>', 'The food looks really good and the added elements go well with the overall cocept.', '2011-07-29 18:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484487, 964025, 86090, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.', '2011-07-29 18:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484488, 964270, 86090, '<td valign="top">I like the presentation as well as the added colors. Very nice!</td>', 'I like the presentation as well as the added colors. Very nice!', '2011-07-29 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484520, 964206, 135937, '<td valign="top">This looks divine; what delectable sweets for a beautiful photograph.</td>', 'This looks divine; what delectable sweets for a beautiful photograph.', '2011-07-29 20:11:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6484549, 964181, 132251, '<td valign="top">into the abyss...</td>', 'into the abyss...', '2011-07-29 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484578, 964289, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to leave comments after voting earlier. I like the arrangement of the sushi rolls on the bamboo placemat. It is a good shot but has the promise of being better and achieving high marks. Sushi rolls look good but could look better if the highlights were not blown. It''s overexposed on the lighter colors such that in some places there is very little detail in the individual grains of rice and the chopsticks also seem blown out too. Be careful with the exposure - some details can be recovered in PP but not all. The sliced ginger and the green wasabi seem to be placed in the composition as an afterthought. Mayhap if they were placed in those tiny dishes it would help the strengthen the composition and add more visual interest.</td>', 'Coming back to leave comments after voting earlier. I like the arrangement of the sushi rolls on the bamboo placemat. It is a good shot but has the promise of being better and achieving high marks. Sushi rolls look good but could look better if the highlights were not blown. It''s overexposed on the lighter colors such that in some places there is very little detail in the individual grains of rice and the chopsticks also seem blown out too. Be careful with the exposure - some details can be recovered in PP but not all. The sliced ginger and the green wasabi seem to be placed in the composition as an afterthought. Mayhap if they were placed in those tiny dishes it would help the strengthen the composition and add more visual interest.', '2011-07-29 22:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484579, 964238, 110967, '<td valign="top">very cool lighting and processing - 8<br/>I fear this won''t do well as it''s not typical dpc stuff but i wish you the best</td>', 'very cool lighting and processing - 8I fear this won''t do well as it''s not typical dpc stuff but i wish you the best', '2011-07-29 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484660, 963899, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Lydia, I presume.  Sorry, just perusing, not voting.  But delightful and very entertaining!</td>', 'LOL!  Lydia, I presume.  Sorry, just perusing, not voting.  But delightful and very entertaining!', '2011-07-30 02:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484686, 964130, 22459, '<td valign="top">nice image of the meal but the background distracts actually more to the point the background colour distracts.</td>', 'nice image of the meal but the background distracts actually more to the point the background colour distracts.', '2011-07-30 05:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484688, 964270, 22459, '<td valign="top">Joe Black....my friend, my lifetime partner, my worst enemy...... I like the shot.</td>', 'Joe Black....my friend, my lifetime partner, my worst enemy...... I like the shot.', '2011-07-30 05:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484689, 964275, 22459, '<td valign="top">nice cup of tea served in lovely china on a beautiful floral tablecloth........you must be English. :)</td>', 'nice cup of tea served in lovely china on a beautiful floral tablecloth........you must be English. :)', '2011-07-30 05:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484690, 964293, 22459, '<td valign="top">boys will be boys........great image.</td>', 'boys will be boys........great image.', '2011-07-30 05:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484691, 964180, 22459, '<td valign="top">cool..... I have this all the time just add a bit of onion and perfect</td>', 'cool..... I have this all the time just add a bit of onion and perfect', '2011-07-30 05:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484692, 964276, 22459, '<td valign="top">Aramaic? is that a religious cross I see? I''m not sure what this has to do with the challenge. If your intention was for a brown ribbon then my vote may help you.If your intentions weren''t for a brown...well sorry about the vote.</td>', 'Aramaic? is that a religious cross I see? I''m not sure what this has to do with the challenge. If your intention was for a brown ribbon then my vote may help you.If your intentions weren''t for a brown...well sorry about the vote.', '2011-07-30 06:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484693, 964287, 22459, '<td valign="top">love the point of view....never eaten them before but would love to try.</td>', 'love the point of view....never eaten them before but would love to try.', '2011-07-30 06:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484695, 964077, 22459, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2011-07-30 06:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484697, 964206, 22459, '<td valign="top">If you made these...will you marry me :)  If you brought these...will you marry me :) If your a guy...we must have similar taste, disregard the proposal. <br/> <br/>Great photo.</td>', 'If you made these...will you marry me :)  If you brought these...will you marry me :) If your a guy...we must have similar taste, disregard the proposal.  Great photo.', '2011-07-30 06:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484699, 964216, 22459, '<td valign="top">yummy that looks so nice and healthy.</td>', 'yummy that looks so nice and healthy.', '2011-07-30 06:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484708, 964270, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colors and focus. I think you could have improved the impact of the image by positioning and cropping the image to be a bit more balanced. The circle of the cup is good, but the clipped handle is a bummer. Positioned so the handle is in and balanced along with the saucer being positioned in the frame similarly on all four corners would have made this a stronger image. Now to go refill my cup. ;)</td>', 'Pleasing colors and focus. I think you could have improved the impact of the image by positioning and cropping the image to be a bit more balanced. The circle of the cup is good, but the clipped handle is a bummer. Positioned so the handle is in and balanced along with the saucer being positioned in the frame similarly on all four corners would have made this a stronger image. Now to go refill my cup. ;)', '2011-07-30 07:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484711, 964077, 53147, '<td valign="top">I do love a blackberry smoothie and this one looks yummy. The presentation photographically speaking is a bit rough. I figure those are blackberries in the background but they don''t stand out well. Cleaning up the plate from the berry juice would have been a good call as well.</td>', 'I do love a blackberry smoothie and this one looks yummy. The presentation photographically speaking is a bit rough. I figure those are blackberries in the background but they don''t stand out well. Cleaning up the plate from the berry juice would have been a good call as well.', '2011-07-30 07:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484718, 964280, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, I''m going to give you a 10 just because they are my fave muffin. No actually it''s a great pic as well, with nice shallow DOF.</td>', 'Oh yeah, I''m going to give you a 10 just because they are my fave muffin. No actually it''s a great pic as well, with nice shallow DOF.', '2011-07-30 08:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484719, 964240, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy and healthy just my type of food, and oh yeah shot like a pro, 9.</td>', 'Looks yummy and healthy just my type of food, and oh yeah shot like a pro, 9.', '2011-07-30 08:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484720, 963820, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great conversion, and I love all that food.</td>', 'Great conversion, and I love all that food.', '2011-07-30 08:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484721, 964141, 114285, '<td valign="top">MMMM looks yummy. 9</td>', 'MMMM looks yummy. 9', '2011-07-30 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484730, 963633, 53147, '<td valign="top">Love banana bread. I may have gone with a bit more in focus, having that middle loaf pretty sharp with the other two OOF. My eye desires to see the texture of the loaf better. My mouth desires to eat the loaf. ;)</td>', 'Love banana bread. I may have gone with a bit more in focus, having that middle loaf pretty sharp with the other two OOF. My eye desires to see the texture of the loaf better. My mouth desires to eat the loaf. ;)', '2011-07-30 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
