(6485032, 964250, 28427, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see your recipe since they never succeed when I make them (I try to make the long ones, covered with a chocolate cover (ganache) and stuffed with confectioner''s cream)</td>', 'Can''t wait to see your recipe since they never succeed when I make them (I try to make the long ones, covered with a chocolate cover (ganache) and stuffed with confectioner''s cream)', '2011-07-30 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485085, 964249, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment after voting earlier. Visually the composition is quite lovely with interesting angle, textures, and color. Lighting is good but there are a few blown highlights tending to a high key. Love how vibrant the red and green topping is on the pearl tapioca pudding. Not a big fan of the large black border - a larger view to give us more to ''taste'' would have made this a stronger composition. For a food combo, I have to admit the pairing with something sweet &amp; desertlike with that of smokey tuna fish is a bit odd. Weather it was done because it tastes good together or just for the aesthetics for the photo is a question...but sweet and salty/smokey might be a good pairing....Overall very nicely captured and done - 7.</td>', 'Coming back to comment after voting earlier. Visually the composition is quite lovely with interesting angle, textures, and color. Lighting is good but there are a few blown highlights tending to a high key. Love how vibrant the red and green topping is on the pearl tapioca pudding. Not a big fan of the large black border - a larger view to give us more to ''taste'' would have made this a stronger composition. For a food combo, I have to admit the pairing with something sweet & desertlike with that of smokey tuna fish is a bit odd. Weather it was done because it tastes good together or just for the aesthetics for the photo is a question...but sweet and salty/smokey might be a good pairing....Overall very nicely captured and done - 7.', '2011-07-30 18:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485088, 964186, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment after voting earlier. Great lighting on your subject that shows off the nice golden crisp brown of the cinnabon along with the white sugary-sweet tasting frosting. Simple presentation with a widescreen view giving the viewer ''the big picture''. The widescreen view however contrasts with the small size of the cinnabon on the plate - meaning a smaller plate would make the cinnabon fill the screen more in conjunction with the ''big'' feeling one gets from a widescreen view. Overall, a great simple and clean presentation of this sweet treat:-)</td>', 'Coming back to comment after voting earlier. Great lighting on your subject that shows off the nice golden crisp brown of the cinnabon along with the white sugary-sweet tasting frosting. Simple presentation with a widescreen view giving the viewer ''the big picture''. The widescreen view however contrasts with the small size of the cinnabon on the plate - meaning a smaller plate would make the cinnabon fill the screen more in conjunction with the ''big'' feeling one gets from a widescreen view. Overall, a great simple and clean presentation of this sweet treat:-)', '2011-07-30 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485093, 964206, 43463, '<td valign="top">MMMMmmmm those strawberries look absolutely delicious! The chocolate coating is more of a art design making it almost too good to eat...almost;-) And it''s not just strawberries but some rasberries and blackberries dipped in chocolate by the looks of it. Nicely presented with a dainty plate that helps make the  chocolate drenched strawberries fill the screen. Nicely paired with a cup of coffee or perhaps tea - the invoked idea of an afternoon snack. Lighting is fabulous showcasing all the tasty details and the vibrant reds of strawberries. Love the steam coming from the cup which is a nice attention to detail. This is a wonderful visual treat - a great big 10.</td>', 'MMMMmmmm those strawberries look absolutely delicious! The chocolate coating is more of a art design making it almost too good to eat...almost;-) And it''s not just strawberries but some rasberries and blackberries dipped in chocolate by the looks of it. Nicely presented with a dainty plate that helps make the  chocolate drenched strawberries fill the screen. Nicely paired with a cup of coffee or perhaps tea - the invoked idea of an afternoon snack. Lighting is fabulous showcasing all the tasty details and the vibrant reds of strawberries. Love the steam coming from the cup which is a nice attention to detail. This is a wonderful visual treat - a great big 10.', '2011-07-30 18:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485127, 964275, 130849, '<td valign="top">Now that made me laugh!</td>', 'Now that made me laugh!', '2011-07-30 20:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485198, 963633, 90414, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and shallow focus (and banana bread!) Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and shallow focus (and banana bread!) Very nice.', '2011-07-30 21:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485202, 964233, 90414, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks delicious... nice image.</td>', 'Wow, this looks delicious... nice image.', '2011-07-30 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485413, 964249, 53147, '<td valign="top">The smoked tuna sounds lovely, the pudding I would be willing to try. The image isnt grabbing me so much. Border is a bit heavy for my tastes, the drips on the plate (intentional or not) just look messy and the lighting doesn''t do a whole lot for your tuna. Less bright and a slightly different presentation could have improved this image and highlighted your meal better.</td>', 'The smoked tuna sounds lovely, the pudding I would be willing to try. The image isnt grabbing me so much. Border is a bit heavy for my tastes, the drips on the plate (intentional or not) just look messy and the lighting doesn''t do a whole lot for your tuna. Less bright and a slightly different presentation could have improved this image and highlighted your meal better.', '2011-07-31 07:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485414, 964186, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you may have had a stronger image if you had taken the picture from the top, allowing for a big square crop, using the plate as the background and filling the screen with cinnamon roll. The skinniness of the image doesn''t do much for your presentation. Would gladly eat the roll though any day. ;)</td>', 'I think you may have had a stronger image if you had taken the picture from the top, allowing for a big square crop, using the plate as the background and filling the screen with cinnamon roll. The skinniness of the image doesn''t do much for your presentation. Would gladly eat the roll though any day. ;)', '2011-07-31 07:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485415, 964236, 53147, '<td valign="top">I would gladly sit down to this meal and chow down. From a foodie perspective this looks yummy. Photographically speaking it''s not really grabbing me. It certainly is yellow. I may have edited it in a way to make the items int he dish stand out color wise - making the broccoli more green, carrots more orange, getting the colors to be more pronounced and fresh rather than just "yeller". But again - would love the invite over for dinner. ;)</td>', 'I would gladly sit down to this meal and chow down. From a foodie perspective this looks yummy. Photographically speaking it''s not really grabbing me. It certainly is yellow. I may have edited it in a way to make the items int he dish stand out color wise - making the broccoli more green, carrots more orange, getting the colors to be more pronounced and fresh rather than just "yeller". But again - would love the invite over for dinner. ;)', '2011-07-31 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485421, 964206, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Great colours, lighting and textures. My only minor complaint would be that the cup is slightly out of focus, in which I mean it''s neither properly in focus as a foreground element, or properly out of focus as a background element.<br/> <br/>Other than that, really like it, and could well imagine it in a food magazine or advertising brochure. 9.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Great colours, lighting and textures. My only minor complaint would be that the cup is slightly out of focus, in which I mean it''s neither properly in focus as a foreground element, or properly out of focus as a background element. Other than that, really like it, and could well imagine it in a food magazine or advertising brochure. 9.', '2011-07-31 08:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485422, 964064, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure red and green are complimentary :)<br/> <br/>Nice clean well lit shot, very stock like, kind of thing I can imagine hanging on the wall of a health food restaurant. 8.</td>', 'I''m not sure red and green are complimentary :) Nice clean well lit shot, very stock like, kind of thing I can imagine hanging on the wall of a health food restaurant. 8.', '2011-07-31 08:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
