(6488547, 964216, 10785, '<td valign="top">The food looks exquisite. I think it is sharp and has great color which is an effect of the wonderful even lighting. What I see as kind of a drawback is the blurred background at the top of the image. My eye keeps wandering off the subject to the background to wonder about that lemon masquerading as an onion up there. When I scroll down and lose the background my eye comfortably rests on the subject in admiration. However bring the blurred background up again and I just can''t help but look there.</td>', 'The food looks exquisite. I think it is sharp and has great color which is an effect of the wonderful even lighting. What I see as kind of a drawback is the blurred background at the top of the image. My eye keeps wandering off the subject to the background to wonder about that lemon masquerading as an onion up there. When I scroll down and lose the background my eye comfortably rests on the subject in admiration. However bring the blurred background up again and I just can''t help but look there.', '2011-08-02 12:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488556, 964079, 10785, '<td valign="top">A little close on the crop but the picture looks good. Your white balance is slightly off by looking at the bar code which is supposed to be white but looks blue. However I don''t really mind that because it puts a nice cast of light onto the chicken to make it look more delicious.</td>', 'A little close on the crop but the picture looks good. Your white balance is slightly off by looking at the bar code which is supposed to be white but looks blue. However I don''t really mind that because it puts a nice cast of light onto the chicken to make it look more delicious.', '2011-08-02 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488564, 964249, 10785, '<td valign="top">Overwhelming border seriously detracts.</td>', 'Overwhelming border seriously detracts.', '2011-08-02 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488586, 964180, 10785, '<td valign="top">The food and the presentation looks good. There is just some uneven lighting across the photo. A little too dark on the right. I think the use of a reflector might take care of that for you next time.</td>', 'The food and the presentation looks good. There is just some uneven lighting across the photo. A little too dark on the right. I think the use of a reflector might take care of that for you next time.', '2011-08-02 12:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
