(6489023, 964276, 66398, '<td valign="top">This has a great thumbnail image which made me click on it. <br/> <br/>I don''t see how this has to do with the challenge. Maybe it is some sort of clear or golden drink in a blue glass?? I don''t know but the title is confusing too. Aramaic is the language spoken in the time of Jesus. I''m not sure what that has to do with breakfast or even food at all much less a recipe. Maybe I''m just missing the point of your image.<br/> <br/>If I were to vote on quality alone I would say it has complementary color and composition but it is quite grainy. That can be attractive on some photos but I do not find it attractive here.</td>', 'This has a great thumbnail image which made me click on it.  I don''t see how this has to do with the challenge. Maybe it is some sort of clear or golden drink in a blue glass?? I don''t know but the title is confusing too. Aramaic is the language spoken in the time of Jesus. I''m not sure what that has to do with breakfast or even food at all much less a recipe. Maybe I''m just missing the point of your image. If I were to vote on quality alone I would say it has complementary color and composition but it is quite grainy. That can be attractive on some photos but I do not find it attractive here.', '2011-08-02 16:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489025, 964284, 66398, '<td valign="top">Makes my mouth water.</td>', 'Makes my mouth water.', '2011-08-02 16:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
