(6489034, 964240, 66398, '<td valign="top">A slightly larger dof where the whole finished dish is in the focus field but the ingredients in the background are out of the focus field would have made this one a little better.</td>', 'A slightly larger dof where the whole finished dish is in the focus field but the ingredients in the background are out of the focus field would have made this one a little better.', '2011-08-02 16:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489084, 964064, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tiny bit more diffusion on the light at camera top left. The colors are great!! Maybe a different title like "Garden Salad ingredients" or something else. The title as is just tells me you chose some colorful food that was photographic and that this is not actually recipe ingredients. Not voting down for it but some may be.</td>', 'Maybe a tiny bit more diffusion on the light at camera top left. The colors are great!! Maybe a different title like "Garden Salad ingredients" or something else. The title as is just tells me you chose some colorful food that was photographic and that this is not actually recipe ingredients. Not voting down for it but some may be.', '2011-08-02 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
