(6489090, 963899, 66398, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the softness of the photograph but I think if the turtle were processed on a different layer with a little more contrast or added blacks it would stand out more. I can show you what I mean after the challenge is over if you''d like. (just pm me)</td>', 'Cute. I like the softness of the photograph but I think if the turtle were processed on a different layer with a little more contrast or added blacks it would stand out more. I can show you what I mean after the challenge is over if you''d like. (just pm me)', '2011-08-02 17:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
