(6489094, 964247, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little on the dark side for the photo content. You may want to check your monitor calibration. I''m viewing on two different monitors, neither of which is calibrated, but I know the main one I''m using is set a little too bright and your photo is still a little too dark on that one. So if someone is viewing on one that isn''t calibrated and on the dark side your photo is going to be pretty dark. I like the idea of this though. Maybe a little extra light behind the subject(s) to the right side of the camera view.</td>', 'A little on the dark side for the photo content. You may want to check your monitor calibration. I''m viewing on two different monitors, neither of which is calibrated, but I know the main one I''m using is set a little too bright and your photo is still a little too dark on that one. So if someone is viewing on one that isn''t calibrated and on the dark side your photo is going to be pretty dark. I like the idea of this though. Maybe a little extra light behind the subject(s) to the right side of the camera view.', '2011-08-02 17:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489099, 964249, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The lighting, composition, color, contrast, key, and content are all spot on imho. Looks like 3 lights maybe? My only little nitpick is the spots on the plate. I don''t know if it''s part of the tuna or some spices or if it''s intentional for presentation but for me it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nicely done. The lighting, composition, color, contrast, key, and content are all spot on imho. Looks like 3 lights maybe? My only little nitpick is the spots on the plate. I don''t know if it''s part of the tuna or some spices or if it''s intentional for presentation but for me it''s a bit distracting.', '2011-08-02 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489106, 964277, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think I would have used a larger dof for this. And maybe tone down the yellows a tiny bit. Nicely laid out and composed.</td>', 'I think I would have used a larger dof for this. And maybe tone down the yellows a tiny bit. Nicely laid out and composed.', '2011-08-02 17:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489115, 964212, 66398, '<td valign="top">A different composition and maybe some bananas in the shot would have made this one better imho. Even if the banana''s were in the background with a shallow dof.</td>', 'A different composition and maybe some bananas in the shot would have made this one better imho. Even if the banana''s were in the background with a shallow dof.', '2011-08-02 17:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489119, 964216, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy!! Well photographed. The lighting on the rice is perfect. But the trade off I think is that the yellow topping (lemon I assume) is a little to harshly lit. Maybe some directed diffusion would have helped with that. Very nicely done though.</td>', 'Looks yummy!! Well photographed. The lighting on the rice is perfect. But the trade off I think is that the yellow topping (lemon I assume) is a little to harshly lit. Maybe some directed diffusion would have helped with that. Very nicely done though.', '2011-08-02 17:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489124, 964155, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and this looks very good. The lighting may be a little too high key but it could be the monitors I''m using to view it.</td>', 'I like the composition and this looks very good. The lighting may be a little too high key but it could be the monitors I''m using to view it.', '2011-08-02 17:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489128, 964262, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very awesome! I love it when someone meets the challenge by being outside of the box. Well thought out and well composed, lit, and photographed. 10</td>', 'Very awesome! I love it when someone meets the challenge by being outside of the box. Well thought out and well composed, lit, and photographed. 10', '2011-08-02 17:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489132, 964257, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well composed and great use of background materials for this shot. The lighting in the center of the food plate is just a little to hard. Maybe if the light source for the plate was just a little further back it would have diffused it enough.</td>', 'Well composed and great use of background materials for this shot. The lighting in the center of the food plate is just a little to hard. Maybe if the light source for the plate was just a little further back it would have diffused it enough.', '2011-08-02 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489183, 964238, 66398, '<td valign="top">Or fortune tellers stew. I see stuff in there. lol. A cute bulldog face, etc. I love the colors but, I''m not sure how appetizing it looks to me. 8</td>', 'Or fortune tellers stew. I see stuff in there. lol. A cute bulldog face, etc. I love the colors but, I''m not sure how appetizing it looks to me. 8', '2011-08-02 17:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
