(6489199, 964206, 66398, '<td valign="top">The light on the right needs to be diffused where it hits the berries. The lighting on the strawberry on the left is much more attractive. The difficulty with this might be not enough light on the white cup but if you were to block the light being used on the right so that it hits mostly just the cup and then add a more diffused light or bounce some light back in on the berries on the right it just migh work. it looks very yummy though.</td>', 'The light on the right needs to be diffused where it hits the berries. The lighting on the strawberry on the left is much more attractive. The difficulty with this might be not enough light on the white cup but if you were to block the light being used on the right so that it hits mostly just the cup and then add a more diffused light or bounce some light back in on the berries on the right it just migh work. it looks very yummy though.', '2011-08-02 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489201, 964240, 86090, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, the elements added as bg are a nice touch!</td>', 'I really like this one, the elements added as bg are a nice touch!', '2011-08-02 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
