(6489294, 964270, 66398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and color. There is a little tension in the composition with the cup handle on the bottom and the cup edge at the bottom and top of the photo. A tiny bit more dof would have been my preference but this works as it is.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and color. There is a little tension in the composition with the cup handle on the bottom and the cup edge at the bottom and top of the photo. A tiny bit more dof would have been my preference but this works as it is.', '2011-08-02 18:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489295, 964025, 66398, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty darn impressive capture of an exploding egg. I''ll be curious to check out your description at the end to find out how you did it.</td>', 'That''s a pretty darn impressive capture of an exploding egg. I''ll be curious to check out your description at the end to find out how you did it.', '2011-08-02 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
