(6493724, 964149, 66398, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CNovack:</b></div><hr/><i> I have no idea what I am looking at here. Perhaps that is the recipe - to guess what this dish could be - a top hat or mayhap a bowl of something sweet or maybe even a cup of coffee. Oh, wait that MUST be it! The world is all grey and fuzzy when we awake all bleary eyed and just wanting to go back to bed. One plods into the kitchen to grab a cup of coffee - we take a look at it all blurry and sleepy before we take that first gulp that will then bring everything back into focus!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I never would have seen that but that''s amazing. It sounds so plausible except for the title. Hmm maybe not. I guess the title could work for that idea too. Too bad it''s a pot of beans and rice. That would have been really cool if you were right.</td>', 'Originally posted by CNovack: I have no idea what I am looking at here. Perhaps that is the recipe - to guess what this dish could be - a top hat or mayhap a bowl of something sweet or maybe even a cup of coffee. Oh, wait that MUST be it! The world is all grey and fuzzy when we awake all bleary eyed and just wanting to go back to bed. One plods into the kitchen to grab a cup of coffee - we take a look at it all blurry and sleepy before we take that first gulp that will then bring everything back into focus!!!   I never would have seen that but that''s amazing. It sounds so plausible except for the title. Hmm maybe not. I guess the title could work for that idea too. Too bad it''s a pot of beans and rice. That would have been really cool if you were right.', '2011-08-05 01:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
