(6494211, 964187, 90495, '<td valign="top">Everything is in focus, a big nono in food photography. You need to concentrate on the item being presented. My eyes are trying to find a spot to settle on but they can''t which makes this photo confusing.</td>', 'Everything is in focus, a big nono in food photography. You need to concentrate on the item being presented. My eyes are trying to find a spot to settle on but they can''t which makes this photo confusing.', '2011-08-05 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
