(6494269, 964206, 86090, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> Your not getting that at IHOP! fantastic shot- good lighting and all- but you won based upon sheer desirability of the food, and the steam from the coffee. was that a matchstick in the coffee cup? super work, congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The steam was hot (really hot) water (had to be since my house wasn''t that cold), which I would pour in the cup and then take as many shots as I could and then reapeat until I had a good amount of pictures to choose from.</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: Your not getting that at IHOP! fantastic shot- good lighting and all- but you won based upon sheer desirability of the food, and the steam from the coffee. was that a matchstick in the coffee cup? super work, congrats!   The steam was hot (really hot) water (had to be since my house wasn''t that cold), which I would pour in the cup and then take as many shots as I could and then reapeat until I had a good amount of pictures to choose from.', '2011-08-05 12:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
